  "edda_adaptations": [
    "one canonical GP record shared with creation owners and the legacy srd521_gold value; four new denomination counts beside it",
    "GM-recorded charge, offer, valuable, lifestyle period, inclusion mark, magic-item policy, service offer and settlement class; no existing issue owns any of them",
    "a lifestyle choice the holding cannot cover is rejected and nothing is recorded",
    "inclusion of an inn stay or meal is a GM mark; no automatic row mapping or daily quantity",
    "an odd half-cost sale is unavailable",
    "sale of an item whose acquisition record names a crafting receipt is unavailable here",
    "a 'worth N+ GP' component adds N unless the GM offer names a higher value",
    "a hired higher-level slot has no price",
    "magic-item rarity values and availability text are shown to the GM and never applied or enforced"
  ],
